sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as The owner
    participant H as core (hub role)
    participant D as devices registry
    participant L as ctx.link
    participant N as node · the Mac at home

    U->>H: 「家里那台电脑上有个叫报销的文件夹，找出来发我」<br/>(there's a folder called 报销 on the computer at home, find it and send it to me)
    H->>D: resolve the alias 「家里那台」 (the one at home)
    D-->>H: node-home
    alt online
        H->>L: connect(node-home)
        L->>N: bring up the link
        H->>N: agent.run
        N-->>H: result + attachments
        H-->>U: found it, sending it over
    else offline
        H-->>U: that computer is offline right now (last seen 3 hours ago)
        Note over H: no brute-force retries, it just says so
    end
